WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:03.330
For weeks they'd threatened to retaliate.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:10.049
Then late Friday, Iranian Revolutionary Guard
commandos hovering over the Stena Impero,

00:00:10.049 --> 00:00:11.959
made their move.

00:00:11.959 --> 00:00:17.760
Raiding the British flagged oil tanker in
International waters.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.740
And forcing it to sail to Iran.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:27.220
Britain has demanded the release of the vessel
and condemned what it called a hostile act.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:34.230
This is about the safety and security of British
and international shipping in one of the most

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.960
important seaways in the world.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:43.060
That is why we are calling on Iran to reverse
this illegal act.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.190
We are looking for ways to deescalate the
situation, but we`re also very clear that

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.570
we will do what it takes to ensure the safety
and security of British and international

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.300
shipping.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.940
The Stena Impero is now docked in the Iranian
port of Bandar Abbas.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.149
Its 23 crew said to be in good health.

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:06.290
But audio exchanges between a British warship
and the Iranian Special Forces moments before

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.100
the capture reveal the tension in the region.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:13.640
"You must not impair, impede, obstruct or
hamper the passage of the Stena Impero."

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.430
"This is Sepah navy patrol boat.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:16.620
No challenge is intended.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:17.810
No challenge is intended.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:22.510
I want to inspect the ship for security reasons.

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:23.510
Over."

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:35.870
"Please confirm that you are not intending
to violate international law by unlawfully

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:43.259
attempting to boat the Mv Stena."

00:01:43.259 --> 00:01:48.869
Iran's foreign minister on a visit to Venezuela
is said to view the seizure as tit for tat

00:01:48.869 --> 00:01:54.030
following the impounding of an Iranian vessel
in Gibraltar earlier this month.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:59.759
The Grace 1 was seized by British forces,
suspected of breaching sanctions on Syria.

00:01:59.759 --> 00:02:04.000
For its 
part the UK insists it's upholding international law.

